# PR 18 (stack18) replaced the botocore git submodule with vendored
# files in share/; this stack dropped share/botocore/ and went
# Smithy-only. The contributor-facing AOT generator (builder-bin/
# gen_classes.pl) still reads from `botocore/botocore/data/`, so CI
# workflows fetch botocore on the fly into `botocore/` at the SHA
# pinned in etc/botocore-pin.sha. Anchor with a leading slash so
# this only matches the repo-root checkout dir.
/botocore/

# share/smithy/ Smithy IR is vendored from awslabs/aws-sdk-rust at
# the SHA pinned in share/smithy/.upstream-sha. The .smithy.json
# files ARE tracked in git (so the dist ships them as-is, no
# build-time vendoring step required). Use `make vendor-smithy` to
# refresh the tree from upstream after bumping .upstream-sha.

